{"id":"15ad878563670014","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-vopenka-principle.md","title":"Vopěnka's Principle (Axiom)","display":"thm-vopenka-principle — Vopěnka's Principle (Axiom)","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-vopenka-principle","aliases":["58-thm-vopenka-principle","Vopěnka's Principle","VP"],"display":"thm-vopenka-principle — Vopěnka's Principle (Axiom)","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-vopenka-principle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-vopenka-principle</span><span>Vopěnka's Principle</span><span>VP</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-vopenka-principle — Vopěnka's Principle (Axiom)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5578254565969219\" href=\"?note=5578254565969219\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span> 为集合大小的一阶语言</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\">\\(\\forall^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\)</span> 为元语言中的类全称量词</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C;\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C;\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-结构的真类</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:M\\preccurlyeq N\">\\(j:M\\preccurlyeq N\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VP}\">\\(\\mathrm{VP}\\)</span> 为 Vopěnka 原理</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 是依赖文件的四元接口；本命题中的嵌入固定在同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>。真类性按 <code>58-df-class-embedding-data</code> 的一元定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}vopenka\\text{-}principle}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VP}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\forall^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\mathcal C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C;\\mathcal L)\n\\to\\exists M,N\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\bigl(\nM\\neq N\\land\\exists j\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,\\mathcal L)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}vopenka\\text{-}principle}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VP}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\forall^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\mathcal C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C;\\mathcal L)\n\\to\\exists M,N\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\bigl(\nM\\neq N\\land\\exists j\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,\\mathcal L)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Vopěnka: introduced principle.</li>\n<li>Very high consistency strength.</li>\n<li>VP 是超出 ZFC 的大基数公理，而不是 ZFC 定理；量化对象必须是固定集合大小语言中的结构真类。</li>\n<li>恰当强度的 extendible 基数真类可推出 VP；单个 extendible 基数并不等同于完整 VP。</li>\n<li>Applications: category theory, model theory.</li>\n<li>Related: indiscernibles, reflection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5578254565969219","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)$ 表示 $j:M\\preccurlyeq N$（see [[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}$ 取 [[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall^{\\mathsf{Cls}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C;\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"j:M\\preccurlyeq N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}vopenka\\text{-}principle}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VP}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\forall^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\mathcal C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C;\\mathcal L)\n\\to\\exists M,N\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\bigl(\nM\\neq N\\land\\exists j\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,\\mathcal L)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L).","display":true}],"bytes":2255,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4480","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-thm-vopenka-principle.md|58-thm-vopenka-principle]]（batch02）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-279","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellorder-equivalent.md]]\n[[58-thm-aleph-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-completeness.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category-theory.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category.md]]\n[[58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]\n[[58-thm-beth-function-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-boolean-valued-model.m